    "title": "Yankees risk losing a defensive strength by moving Cody Bellinger - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Wilson ,\n7 hours ago\nMoving Cody Bellinger back to center field would solve one problem for the Yankees. It could also create another in left. With Trent Grisham reaching free agency, New York has to decide whether to shop for a center fielder or use the defensive versatility already on its roster. My preference is to keep Bellinger in left unless the club finds a credible replacement there first.\nRead full article",
